# Betaflight 4.4.2 / SPEEDYBEEF405MINI; verify radio AUX assignments first.
# AUX1 high: ARM. AUX2 low: Acro; middle: Angle; high: Horizon.
# AUX3 high: beeper. AUX4 high: flip over after crash.
aux 0 0 0 1700 2100 0 0
aux 1 1 1 1300 1700 0 0
aux 2 13 2 1700 2100 0 0
aux 3 35 3 1700 2100 0 0
aux 4 2 1 1700 2100 0 0
save
